{"hymn":"S583","parent":"E1212","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Ya el Señor mostró Su plan","subtitle":"Varios aspectos de la vida interior—El crecimiento en vida","syl":{"n1":"Ya","n2":"el","n3":["Se","i"],"n4":["ñor","t"],"n5":["mos","i"],"n6":["tró","t"],"n7":"Su","n8":"plan","n9":"A","n10":["to","i"],"n11":["do","t"],"n12":["san","i"],"n13":["to","t"],"n14":"fiel","n15":"Que","n16":["de","i"],"n17":["ja","t"],"n18":["es","i"],"n19":["te","t"],"n20":["mun","i"],"n21":["do‿a","m"],"n22":["trás","t"],"n23":"Y‿es","n24":["vir","i"],"n25":["gen","t"],"n26":["pa","i"],"n27":["ra","t"],"n28":"Él.","n29":["Pa","i"],"n30":["ra","t"],"n31":"Su","n32":["pro","i"],"n33":["pia","t"],"n34":["No","i"],"n35":["via","t"],"n36":"ser","n37":"Hay","n38":"que","n39":"ser","n40":["co","i"],"n41":["mo","t"],"n42":"Él,","n43":"Y","n44":["dis","i"],"n45":["fru","m"],"n46":["tar","m"],"n47":["lo","t"],"n48":"sin","n49":["ce","i"],"n50":["sar","t"],"n51":"En","n52":["to","i"],"n53":["do‿y","t"],"n54":"por","n55":["do","i"],"n56":["quier.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Oh, haznos esas vírgenes,","Tan llenas de amor,","Que siempre junto al Novio están!","¡Oh, haznos tales hoy!","Que seamos sabios, oh Señor,","Ganando más de Ti;","Gozando a diario del festín,","Pagando el precio aquí."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Las vírgenes madurarán","En vida al crecer;","De una forma muy normal","Comiendo a diario de Él.","Es hoy nuestra necesidad","La madurez, Señor;","No ciencia, dones, o poder,","Mas Cristo en lo interior."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Como simiente viva, Tú","Debes crecer, Señor,","Ganando más terreno así","En nuestro corazón.","Da fuerza al hombre interior,","Y a cada parte ve;","Contigo llénanos, Señor,","Y habita nuestro ser."]}]}